,"stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9290749430656433,"text_excerpt":"I love this place! Food is absolutely delicious. Eggplant sandwich and chicken shawarma are my favs."},{"business_id":"YoGdJUAvQTsFsLw67dRBtg","review_id":"Fkm4FLUMyJdYrwSlVm6tIw","date":"2021-11-16T02:03:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9260833263397217,"text_excerpt":"This is my favorite spot on Maple for an easy and delicious dinner. The staff here are always so attentive, and they know the locals. They always take great care of us. Even when it's busy (especially with a lot of take away orders), they always check in on us and tell us how it's going. I'm A Huge Fan. The shwarma, haloumi, lamb, you name it. They always come out consistently delicious and with huge portions for the price. I love eating in but it's also just a great grab n go dinner. Extra bonus? They're connected to a laundromat next door so if you need to wash anything, even over sized loads, you can score a great meal while you wait! Definitely worth it if you like supporting a delici..."},{"business_id":"YoGdJUAvQTsFsLw67dRBtg","review_id":"d4DBGhOnw0sejpz-dMHYuw","date":"2020-10-26T01:55:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9193529486656189,"text_excerpt":"Small little restaurant on Maple. We arrived and they have a small table with hand sanitizer and masks at the entrance. We were unsure if we chose our table or if someone was supposed to tell us where to sit so we walked to the back counter and the lady at the counter told us to seat ourselves. We ordered the Green Olives Maza which comes with plenty of appetizers. We received the hummus, baba ganuj, and the labneh first. They ALL were amazing. So authentic. So delightful. So tasty! After we received the rest of the appetizers from the green olives maza which were the tabouleh, kibbeh, falafel & grape leaves. Oh my! The best falafels ever! Everything from the green olives maza was so good..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"YoGdJUAvQTsFsLw67dRBtg","photo_id":"ZcLYqtYhHhIO2pZK3fZ0sQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ZcLYqtYhHhIO2pZK3fZ0sQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9282209873199463},{"business_id":"YoGdJUAvQTsFsLw67dRBtg","photo_id":"33IZjGeWysKD50a8tcju3Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/33IZjGeWysKD50a8tcju3Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9282209873199463}]},"notebook_case":null}
